   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every LXC is also declared in NetBox\n(Terraform), in the Ansible inventory,\nand has a role + playbook.\nBackups: PBS snapshots each one.",
